  "published": "2026-06-04T20:15:34.687Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "10.1.0 (minor): dispatches the three new PageAction arms (ADR-0074) via native Playwright calls (FillAsync, Keyboard.PressAsync, Locator.ScrollIntoViewIfNeededAsync); now all 10 arms. The dispatch is extracted into an internal PlaywrightPageActionDispatcher pinned by an execution-coverage test (ADR-0078). 10.0.0: initial release. Microsoft.Playwright-backed IPageLoadTransport per ADR-0053; replaces the deleted WebReaper.Puppeteer satellite in the same release (the v10.0.0 major break). Multi-browser default Chromium; Firefox/WebKit opt-in via PlaywrightBrowser enum. All 7 PageAction arms (ADR-0035) including SemanticAct (ADR-0050); closes the ADR-0004 §\"Out of scope\" four-arm gap the Puppeteer transport had. Requires WebReaper 10.0.0.",
